This is a trial version of the watch face with limited functionality and settings.

The trial version of the watch face has limited functionality.

- Complications cannot be changed;

- Weather mode cannot be switched;

- Digital time cannot be changed;

- Tap zones are not active;

- Minimum AOD mode does not work;

- After a while (when the battery charge drops below 90%), the date will be covered by the text "TAP FOR PREMIUM VERSION"

- Tapping the screen will redirect you to the store with the full version of the watch face;

To access all features, you must purchase the paid full version. You can see the functionality of the full version of the watch face in the screenshots.

Link to the full version of the watch face: https://play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/6798279555567263371/app/4975074154599845100/app-dashboard

- All subsequent screenshots will show the watch face's expanded functionality for review.
